# Frontend Redesign — Gestion School Management Platform

Redesign all frontend pages of the Vue 3 school management app to feel like a modern 2025 SaaS dashboard, guided by the Stitch-generated screens (project `3331276433239099`) and the instructions in [gestion-redesign-prompt.md](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/gestion-redesign-prompt.md). **Only presentation-layer changes** — no logic, API, route, or store modifications.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **PrimeVue v4 integration**: The redesign prompt specifies PrimeVue v4 with the Aura preset. This will be installed via npm alongside the existing TailwindCSS v4 setup. PrimeVue components will be imported on-demand (tree-shakeable) — no global registration of all components.

> [!WARNING]
> **TailwindCSS v4 compatibility**: The project already uses TailwindCSS v4 (`@tailwindcss/vite` plugin). PrimeVue's `@primeuix/styled` theme will be used alongside it. The `@tailwind` directives in [main.css](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/main.css) will be updated to TW v4's `@import "tailwindcss"` syntax.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Foundation — Dependencies & Config

#### [MODIFY] [package.json](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/package.json)
- Add: `primevue`, `@primeuix/themes`, `primeicons`
- Run `npm install`

#### [MODIFY] [index.html](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/index.html)
- Add Google Fonts `Inter` link
- Update `<title>` to `Gestion — School Management`
- Add PrimeIcons CSS link

#### [MODIFY] [main.js](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/main.js)
- Register PrimeVue plugin with Aura theme preset
- Import PrimeIcons CSS
- Keep all existing plugin registrations (Pinia, Router, vue3-toastify, confirmPlugin)

#### [MODIFY] [main.css](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/main.css)
- Switch to TW v4 `@import "tailwindcss"` syntax
- Add design system custom properties (colors, radii, shadows)
- Add `.glass-card` utility class globally
- Add transition utilities

---

### Layout Shell — Sidebar + TopBar

#### [NEW] [MainLayout.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/layout/MainLayout.vue)
- Wrapper that renders `Sidebar` + `TopBar` + `<slot>` content area
- Only shown for authenticated users (non-auth routes)

#### [NEW] [Sidebar.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/layout/Sidebar.vue)
- Collapsible left sidebar (icon+label → icon-only on toggle)
- Role-aware navigation items with icons
- Active route highlighted with colored left border accent
- Footer: user avatar initials, name, role badge, logout icon
- Reproduces the sidebar layout from Stitch screens (Admin Dashboard, Department Management, etc.)

#### [NEW] [TopBar.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/layout/TopBar.vue)
- App logo/name ("Gestion"), hamburger menu to toggle sidebar
- Light/dark mode toggle button
- User avatar (initials) + name + logout button
- Consistent with Stitch screen topbar design

#### [MODIFY] [App.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/App.vue)
- Replace `<Navbar v-if="showNavbar">` with `<MainLayout v-if="showNavbar">` wrapping `<router-view>`
- Auth pages (Login, ForgotPassword, ResetPassword) render without layout
- Keep ConfirmDialog registration as-is

#### [MODIFY] [Navbar.vue](file:///c:/work/New_Node_End/frontend/src/components/common/Navbar.vue)
- Keep file but mark as deprecated (no longer imported in App.vue)

---

